- description: This metric assesses the existence and effectiveness of Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment (CI/CD) workflows within a code repository. It measures whether automated processes for building, testing, and deploying code are implemented and functioning as intended. The scope includes evaluating the completeness of these workflows, identifying any missing automation steps that could hinder development efficiency. Additionally, it highlights the quality of the existing CI/CD practices, such as the reliability of automated tests and the speed of deployment processes. By analyzing these factors, the metric provides insights into potential automation gaps that could impact software delivery and operational performance.

