Metric:
- id: data_pipeline
- name: Data Pipeline Engineering
- description: This metric evaluates the definitions and configurations of data pipelines implemented using orchestration tools such as Airflow, Prefect, and Kedro. It focuses on identifying critical aspects of pipeline robustness, including the presence of retry mechanisms, alerting systems, and observability features. The scope includes assessing how well these pipelines can handle failures, notify stakeholders of issues, and provide insights into their operational performance. By highlighting deficiencies in these areas, the metric aims to ensure that data pipelines are resilient and maintainable. The evaluation is limited to the structural and functional attributes of the pipeline definitions, rather than their execution or performance metrics.

