Metric:
- id: ml.evaluation_practice
- name: Evaluation Practice
- description: The Evaluation Practice metric assesses the comprehensiveness and rigor of the evaluation methodologies employed in machine learning projects. It measures the diversity of performance metrics used to gauge model effectiveness, ensuring that multiple aspects of model performance are considered. Additionally, it evaluates the implementation of fairness checks to identify and mitigate biases in model predictions, promoting equitable outcomes across different demographic groups. The quality of reporting and visualizations is also scrutinized, focusing on clarity, transparency, and the ability to convey insights effectively. This metric serves as a critical indicator of the robustness and ethical considerations in the evaluation phase of machine learning workflows.

